  "notes": [
    "The FullPalette editor and FPPrefs helper each identify as 40.22 and match the Aminet archive. The installer enables execute permission on C/FPPrefs and the shared Startup-sequence runs it immediately after IPrefs.",
    "BetterWB supplies the exact preset edit and activation marker. The checked BCWB release supplies the editor icon, installed palette and icon, and the modified activation script and preset icon.",
    "The stock distribution already starts FPPrefs from C: and carries the active editor. The legacy preset targets BetterWB paths and is retained for stock parity."
